=== lens query test: grain-correct planning ===
-- revenue by city (city | revenue)
  Shelbyville | 7300
  Springfield | 16100
  Capital City | 6500
-- fan-out plan
Sort
  Project
    EquiJoin(city=city)
      GroupBy
        SeqScan(users)
      GroupBy
        EquiJoin(user-id=user-id)
          GroupBy
            SeqScan(orders)
          SeqScan(users)
-- fan-out: credit and revenue by city (city | total-credit | revenue)
  Shelbyville | 20000 | 7300
  Springfield | 40000 | 16100
  Capital City | 40000 | 6500
-- unknown measure is a diagnostic, not a plan
diag 22: unknown measure profit
-- two dims, two measures (city | user-name | total-credit | revenue)
  Shelbyville | Bob | 20000 | 7300
  Springfield | Alice | 10000 | 8800
  Springfield | Carol | 30000 | 7300
  Capital City | Dave | 40000 | 6500
-- filtered fan-out plan (filter under the revenue group)
Sort
  Project
    EquiJoin(city=city)
      GroupBy
        SeqScan(users)
      GroupBy
        EquiJoin(user-id=user-id)
          GroupBy
            Filter
              SeqScan(orders)
          SeqScan(users)
-- product 1 only: credit and revenue by city (city | total-credit | revenue)
  Shelbyville | 20000 | 1500
  Springfield | 40000 | 4500
  Capital City | 40000 | 1500
-- unknown filter column is a diagnostic, not a plan
diag 27: filter column discount is not in the model vocabulary for table orders
-- grain-correct average across the join (city | total-credit | avg-order)
  Shelbyville | 20000 | 2433
  Springfield | 40000 | 2300
  Capital City | 40000 | 3250
-- multi-hop plan (orders -> users -> regions)
Sort
  Project
    GroupBy
      EquiJoin(region-id=region-id)
        EquiJoin(user-id=user-id)
          GroupBy
            SeqScan(orders)
          SeqScan(users)
        SeqScan(regions)
-- revenue by region, two hops away (region | revenue)
  East | 13800
  West | 16100
-- two paths to one table is a diagnostic, not a plan
diag 28: measure fsum on table f reaches dimension tname on table t by more than one many-to-one path: f -> a -> t and f -> b -> t
-- revenue by month bucket (order-date__month | revenue)
  202606 | 14600
  202607 | 15300
-- bucketed plan across a join (derive under the home-grain group)
Sort
  Project
    GroupBy
      EquiJoin(user-id=user-id)
        GroupBy
          Derive(order-date__month)
            SeqScan(orders)
        SeqScan(users)
-- revenue by city and month (city | order-date__month | revenue)
  Shelbyville | 202606 | 800
  Shelbyville | 202607 | 6500
  Springfield | 202606 | 8800
  Springfield | 202607 | 7300
  Capital City | 202606 | 5000
  Capital City | 202607 | 1500
lens-query-test: done
